      "rendered": "Docket"
    },
    "content": {
      "rendered": "\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li>Setup virtual private network</li><li>Create keys for virtual private network</li><li>Distribute keys for virtual private network</li><li>Configure and connect to private network</li><li>Create Password Manager</li></ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Email</h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li>Backup Email (Complete)</li><li>Zip Email (Complete)</li><li>Upload Email Zipped Archived (Scheduled) </li><li>Confirm Download of Zip Archive(Complete)</li></ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Hosting / Domains</h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li>Transfer domain of gravitynotes.org (Complete)</li><li>Set up https and static server for gravitynotes.org (Complete)</li><li>Move over existing static content (Complete)</li></ul>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n",
      "protected": false
    },
    "excerpt": {
      "rendered": "<p>Setup virtual private network Create keys for virtual private network Distribute keys for virtual private network Configure and connect to private network Create Password Manager Email Backup Email (Complete) Zip Email (Complete) Upload Email Zipped Archived (Scheduled) Confirm Download of Zip Archive(Complete) Hosting / Domains Transfer domain of gravitynotes.org (Complete) Set up https and static <br /><a class=\"read-more-button\" href=\"/?page_id=53\">Read More &raquo;</a></p>\n",
      "protected": false
